{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15300","headline":"妾薄命 · 李端","name":"妾薄命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆妾初嫁君，花鬟如绿云。\n回灯入绮帐，转面脱罗裙。\n折步教人学，偷香与客熏。\n容颜南国重，名字北方闻。\n一从失恩意，转觉身顦顇。\n对镜不梳头，倚窗空落泪。\n新人莫恃新，秋至会无春。\n从来闭在长门者，必是宫中第一人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}